# AI & GPU Algorithms

A personal workspace for AI algorithm implementations and GPU/CUDA programming projects.

## Structure

- `AI algorithms implementations/` — AI algorithm work and HackerRank AI problems.
- `cuda-hpc/` — CUDA / GPU high-performance computing projects.
  - [`01_parallel_ode_integrator/`](cuda-hpc/01_parallel_ode_integrator/) — batched
    ODE solver on the GPU vs a single CPU core. Verified correct, up to a
    **961× speedup** on an RTX 2080 Super, with kernel-vs-transfer profiling
    and an Euler/RK4 comparison. See its
    [REPORT](cuda-hpc/01_parallel_ode_integrator/REPORT.md) for the
    time-complexity analysis.

![CPU vs GPU benchmark](cuda-hpc/01_parallel_ode_integrator/benchmark.png)
